<LevelHeader>
  type = Level
  name = The Hotspot
  description = 
  timestamp = 133643510980727131
</LevelHeader>
<Tips>
  At the start of the level, Dream Dall can swap with the enemy Priest, use the laptop, then Swap back. You never need to deal with the Trackers.
  Dream Dall has a way to reach the laptop that's blocked off, using a perk she has. Long-press on her portrait to review those.
  You just need something there to swap with.
  Have Dream Dall throw her Riot Block onto the square in front of the laptop, then have her Swap with it.
</Tips>

